BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Futureproof your Career with AI
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260804T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260804T173000
UID:6a58e97f71ef136200526391@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for this interactive session with Career Coach in Resi
 dence Sangeetha Dikshit. This session focuses on learning the disruptions
  of AI in workplaces\, and how we can best use the knowledge to thrive in 
 an ever changing environment. Through this session\, learners will underst
 and the key trends shaping the future of work\, use AI to strategically gu
 ide you in your career and learn strategies towards an AI-resilient career
 .\nSangeetha Dikshit\n\, one of TPL's three Spring 2026 Career Coaches in 
 Residence. Sangeetha is a Career and Leadership Coach empowering individua
 ls to navigate career transitions\, develop in-demand skills\, and achieve
  professional success.\nThis program is part of TPL's Career Coaches in Re
 sidence and is generously supported by our lead donor Azrieli Foundation a
 long with supporting donors Fidelity Canada\, Friends of Toronto Public Li
 brary\, South Chapter and\nWilliam and Nona Heaslip Foundation.\nFor more 
 information\, please visit\ntpl.ca/careercoach
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a58e97f71ef136200526391
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
