BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Brentwood Film Club Presents: The Life of Chuck (2025)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260723T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260723T200000
UID:6a3d527b86636e3d0050926c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a screening of\nThe Life of Chuck\n(2025)\nJoin us
  for a screening of\nThe Life of Chuck:\n“The unforgettable\, genre-bend
 ing tale celebrates the life of Charles 'Chuck' Krantz as he experiences t
 he wonder of love\, the heartbreak of loss\, and the multitudes contained 
 in all of us.”\n111 mins (2 hrs)\n14A - Profanity\nThis film will be scr
 eened with English closed-captions (CC) enabled.
LOCATION:Brentwood\, 1st floor\, Community Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a3d527b86636e3d0050926c
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
